						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
							<path d="M6.94 8.98H3.86v10.2h3.08V8.98ZM5.42 4.82a1.78 1.78 0 1 0 0 3.56 1.78 1.78 0 0 0 0-3.56Zm5.26 4.16H7.74v10.2h3.08v-5.35c0-1.49.68-2.38 1.94-2.38 1.16 0 1.72.82 1.72 2.38v5.35h3.08v-6.1c0-2.88-1.54-4.37-3.72-4.37-1.58 0-2.5.86-3.02 1.67h-.14v-1.4Z"></path>
						</svg>
